{"id": "De3qVJQtaRn", "title": "Video by dayzero.story", "description": "Season 2 • Episode 2/5\n3 rules to survive a dead mall. Rule 3 is the scary one. 🔦\nThe doors locked behind them and the power died. Then they met a 12-year-old girl who had been surviving inside alone.\nReal tips from this episode:\n💡 Emergency lights in most buildings last about 90 minutes. Use them to find the way out, not to wait.\n🚪 Fire exits open from the inside. Look for the push bar.\n🏃 Don’t run in the dark. You trip, you make noise, you get noticed.\nComment your RULE 4 👇\nNew here? Every episode works on its own. Episode 1 is on my page.\n#dayzero #survival #animation #survivaltips #aitakeover\nWould you trust her rules?", "channel": "dayzero.story", "uploader_id": "23973906610", "uploader": "Day Zero Stories", "timestamp": 1792829190, "like_count": 519, "comment_count": 10, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1508566784449695a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 73.464, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQN4W_mkFopP5K8D_9u9l4N6tRngli9ygqDRnqlILzvYcihUmEnRYAzWU6CjVfThGdDPgxhD_ziz6fivob2H4Y3Jvn6ZyCuo9BNb_XY.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdrxyBdO-gnDaiQT77rRUUw-2UsF9SriKlYkm-mLMIly_dex3HyZzjz169Akk4MG7rVwDCuRYbK4fhsnRJWyx3oX&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=q7nW2RGTK-YQ7kNvwFhPsSd&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=pmTQJmbk7yaIPf8t_O8dSQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQnUSBwY2SEX879H6HNvlvg0vAApkKyMi_XkkYb4kpuZQ&oe=6AF41482", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 73.464, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtm